{
  "$description": "The component-token layer for the shadcn / Base-UI contract. These are the only tokens components render, published UNPREFIXED (--primary, --card, --input, --ring, --sidebar-*) and mapped into Tailwind's utility namespaces by src/styles/index.css. Every entry references a SEMANTIC token \u2014 never a primitive \u2014 so the contrast gate governs what is actually on screen.",
